0
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:28,270
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">灵梦道</font>

1
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:30,370
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">坐在宇宙中敲醒</font>

2
00:00:30,370 --> 00:00:32,259
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">如风穿堂</font>

3
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:34,360
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">四周冰冷</font>

4
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:35,410
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">如期抵</font>

5
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:38,080
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">东方之眼泪滚烫</font>

6
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,420
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">宇宙撤退</font>

7
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:46,600
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">所有狰狞手响指的声音回答你看她消散不行</font>

8
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,530
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">却一样</font>

9
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:48,640
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">却又算我</font>

10
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:56,600
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">请问你脸庞怎么它会铺开成一团温柔的光</font>

11
00:00:56,600 --> 00:01:01,960
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">抓空却又落在你肩膀</font>

12
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:03,640
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">她没有消失</font>

13
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:09,209
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">只是约好在太空里永恒的飘荡变成云</font>

14
00:01:09,209 --> 00:01:10,769
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">爆破飞船气囊</font>

15
00:01:10,769 --> 00:01:13,409
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">摘着月光从宇宙赶来</font>

16
00:01:13,409 --> 00:01:15,720
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">落在你手掌</font>

17
00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:21,100
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">偷看成千上万美丽生物时代</font>

18
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:22,600
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">别怕</font>

19
00:01:23,620 --> 00:01:25,000
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">当你的树倒下</font>

20
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,420
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">太空就开一朵花</font>

21
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:44,060
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">一开始对亿万颗星辰都念念不忘</font>

22
00:01:45,140 --> 00:01:51,260
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">又或者那次人类影响是会心一场爱什么</font>

23
00:01:51,260 --> 00:01:53,510
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">好像名字消彼长</font>

24
00:01:53,510 --> 00:01:56,060
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">纵然天各两方</font>

25
00:01:56,320 --> 00:02:02,530
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">当我们体内所有的能量会循着爱的力重装</font>

26
00:02:02,530 --> 00:02:11,140
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">没有奢望他会和你再次遇上好长画风</font>

27
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:15,660
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">霞光与火浪还没有消失</font>

28
00:02:15,660 --> 00:02:20,040
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">只是约好在太空里永恒的飘荡</font>

29
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:21,600
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">变成羽毛多</font>

30
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:25,380
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">飞船气囊拽着月光从宇宙赶来</font>

31
00:02:25,380 --> 00:02:26,910
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">落在你手掌</font>

32
00:02:26,910 --> 00:02:35,060
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">弹开头看成千上万美丽星辰是特别怕</font>

33
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:37,000
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">当你的树倒下</font>

34
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:41,320
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">太空就开一朵花</font>

35
00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:52,950
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">可是在新生并未消亡</font>

36
00:02:52,950 --> 00:02:55,080
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">在你的目之所及</font>

37
00:02:55,080 --> 00:03:00,080
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">寻访不再每个神经的脊梁透过气藏</font>

38
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,370
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">当你抬头时</font>

39
00:03:01,370 --> 00:03:02,900
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">遥远的向往</font>

40
00:03:02,900 --> 00:03:06,100
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">你一直到偶然</font>

41
00:03:06,100 --> 00:03:09,730
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">会像守卫永远的主唱</font>

42
00:03:09,730 --> 00:03:13,000
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">别怕当你的树倒下</font>

43
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,260
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">太空就可以落花</font>

44
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:21,320
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">知道人不会笑与爱不会坍塌</font>

45
00:03:21,899 --> 00:03:23,119
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">别怕</font>

46
00:03:23,119 --> 00:03:25,639
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">现在张开手看着你</font>

47
00:03:25,639 --> 00:03:27,080
<font color="#FFFFFF" size="16">正在触碰他</font>
